    "description": "16-band channel vocoder over a bright saw + pulse poly synth, short release for clipped robotic syllables. Sing or speak into the audio interface input chosen in Audio settings (Input); without an open input the vocoder uses its internal vowel test signal. Reference: Kraftwerk - The Robots (1978).",
